meta {
  name: List Assigned Rows (as Producer)
  type: http
  seq: 31
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/carrier-reconciliation/assigned?page=1&pageSize=25
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  pageSize: 25
}

tests {
  test("returns 200 OK", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(200);
  });

  test("the row the owner just assigned, with its upload", function () {
    const row = res.getBody().items.find((item) => item.id === bru.getVar("reconAssignRowId"));
    expect(row).to.not.equal(undefined);
    expect(row.assignment.user.id).to.equal(bru.getVar("currentUserId"));
    expect(row.run.id).to.equal(bru.getVar("reconRunId"));
    expect(row.run.startDate).to.equal("2026-09-01");
  });

  test("only rows assigned to the caller", function () {
    for (const item of res.getBody().items) {
      expect(item.assignment.user.id).to.equal(bru.getVar("currentUserId"));
    }
  });
}

docs {
  # GET /carrier-reconciliation/assigned — the rows assigned to me

  - **Module:** `carrier_reconciliation` (enabled for the agency)
  - **Permission:** `carrier_reconciliation:read` **or** `leads:read`.
    Producer and CSR templates hold `leads:read` and no reconciliation
    permission: they see the rows handed to **them** and nothing else of the
    report.

  The caller's rows still waiting on a decision, on the agency's current
  runs (finished, not replaced by a re-upload), oldest hand-off first — what
  `/reconciliation/assigned` and the Producer Dashboard's "Dash follow-ups"
  panel list. A row leaves the list once it is decided — by the owner, or by
  the outcome the caller finished on it (PAC-173 PR 4). A Sold or Cancel
  rewrite still under way keeps it on the list, with its `outcome`.

  ## Query
  - `page`, `pageSize` (≤ 100, default 25)
  - `userId` — someone else's rows; needs `carrier_reconciliation:read` (403
    otherwise)

  ## Response `200`

  ```json
  { "items": [{ …ReconciliationRowView…,
      "assignment": { "user": { "id": "…", "name": "Pat Producer" },
        "assignedBy": { "id": "…", "name": "Olive Owner" },
        "assignedAt": "2026-10-28T15:04:05.000Z", "note": "Enter the deal" },
      "run": { "id": "…", "filename": "dash-new-business-demo.xlsx",
        "startDate": "2026-09-01", "endDate": "2026-10-31" } }],
    "page": 1, "pageSize": 25, "total": 1, "totalPages": 1 }
  ```

  ## Errors
  - `403` — the module is off for the agency; no permission; `userId` without
    `carrier_reconciliation:read`
}
